### USER MANAGEMENT TESTS
### ========================================

### 11. Get All Users (Authenticated - Success)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Get All Users without Token (Should Fail - Edge Case)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/users

### 13. Get All Users with Invalid Token (Should Fail - Edge Case)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token-12345

### 14. Update Profile (Success)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/update-profile
