### MESSAGE TESTS
### ========================================

### 24. Send Message (Success)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "6af9fd8e3b4bf45b80a88cfa",
  "text": "Hello from Test User One!"
}

### 25. Send Message with Empty Text (Edge Case)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "PASTE_CONVERSATION_ID_HERE",
  "text": ""
}

### 26. Send Message without Token (Should Fail - Edge Case)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "some-id",
  "text": "Unauthorized message"
}

### 27. Send Message with Invalid Conversation ID (Edge Case)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "invalid-conversation-id",
  "text": "Message to nowhere"
}

### 28. Send Message without Conversation ID (Edge Case)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Message without conversation"
}

### 29. Get Messages for Conversation (Success)
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/messages/PASTE_CONVERSATION_ID_HERE
